### VS Code ###
.vscode/

# Real labeled documents for the extraction evaluation harness. Real bank statements and
# receipt photos contain real financial data and must never be committed to a public
# portfolio repo. The harness falls back to its synthetic set when this is empty, so the
# build works for anyone cloning without them (see GoldenSet). The README is kept so the
# label format travels with the project even though the documents themselves do not.
src/test/resources/golden/**
!src/test/resources/golden/README.md
